  "Site down/error": 'Hi! Is this '+CC_NAME+'? Hey, this is '+CC_YOU+' with Sites On Call. I tried to pull up your website and it\u2019s showing an error \u2014 not sure if you knew that. When customers try to find you and can\u2019t get to your site, they just move on to the next guy. We help contractors get a site that actually works and brings in calls. Want to hear more, or should I let you go?',
