const CC_TELLMORE = 'Great! So basically, we build a professional website for you and then write blog posts every month so you start showing up when people search Google for '+CC_TRADE+' in your area. Over time, you get calls straight from Google instead of paying for leads. The best part? No contracts, and you own everything. Would you want to chat with Irene \u2014 she\u2019s the one who can answer all your questions \u2014 sometime this week?';
